Ducted air conditioning provides comfort throughout your home</h2></div></div></div><div class="buttons" ><div class="tfs-button-1"><div ><a class="fusion-button button-flat fusion-button-default-size button-default fusion-button-default button-2 fusion-button-default-span fusion-button-default-type" target="_self" title="Ducted Heat Pump Installers in Christchurch" aria-label="Ducted Heat Pump Installers in Christchurch" href="https://newzealandheatpumps.co.nz/ducted-heat-pumps/"><span class="fusion-button-text awb-button__text awb-button__text--default">Learn More</span></a></div></div></div></div></div><div class="background background-image" style="background-image: url(https://newzealandheatpumps.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/ducted-air-con.jpg);max-width:100%;height:780px;filter: progid:DXImageTransform.Microsoft.AlphaImageLoader(src='https://newzealandheatpumps.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/ducted-air-con.jpg', sizingMethod='scale');" data-imgwidth="1920"></div></li><li data-mute="yes" data-loop="yes" data-autoplay="yes"><div class="slide-content-container slide-content-left" style="display: none;"><div class="slide-content" style=""><div class="heading "><div class="fusion-title-sc-wrapper" style=""><div class="fusion-title title fusion-title-2 fusion-sep-none fusion-title-text fusion-title-size-two" style="--awb-text-color:#ffffff;--awb-margin-top:0px;--awb-margin-bottom:0px;--awb-margin-top-small:0px;--awb-margin-right-small:0px;--awb-margin-bottom-small:20px;--awb-margin-left-small:0px;--awb-sep-color:#ffffff;--awb-font-size:60px;"><h2 class="fusion-title-heading title-heading-left fusion-responsive-typography-calculated" style="margin:0;font-size:1em;--fontSize:60;line-height:1.33;">Building?</h2></div></div></div><div class="caption "><div class="fusion-title-sc-wrapper" style=""><div class="fusion-title title fusion-title-3 fusion-sep-none fusion-title-text fusion-title-size-four" style="--awb-text-color:#ffffff;--awb-margin-top:0px;--awb-margin-bottom:0px;--awb-margin-top-small:0px;--awb-margin-right-small:0px;--awb-margin-bottom-small:20px;--awb-margin-left-small:0px;--awb-sep-color:#ffffff;--awb-font-size:34px;"><h4 class="fusion-title-heading title-heading-left fusion-responsive-typography-calculated" style="margin:0;font-size:1em;--fontSize:34;line-height:1.2;">We can quote off your plans for heat pumps and central heating.</h4></div></div></div><div class="buttons" ><div class="tfs-button-1"><div ><a class="fusion-button button-flat fusion-button-default-size button-default fusion-button-default button-3 fusion-button-default-span fusion-button-default-type" target="_self" title="Heat Pumps for New Home Builds" aria-label="Heat Pumps for New Home Builds" href="https://newzealandheatpumps.co.nz/heat-pumps-for-home/"><span class="fusion-button-text awb-button__text awb-button__text--default">View Details</span></a></div></div></div></div></div><div class="background background-image" style="background-image: url(https://newzealandheatpumps.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/building.jpg);max-width:100%;height:780px;filter: progid:DXImageTransform.Microsoft.AlphaImageLoader(src='https://newzealandheatpumps.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/building.jpg', sizingMethod='scale');" data-imgwidth="1920"></div></li><li data-mute="yes" data-loop="yes" data-autoplay="yes"><div class="slide-content-container slide-content-left" style="display: none;"><div class="slide-content" style=""><div class="heading "><div class="fusion-title-sc-wrapper" style=""><div class="fusion-title title fusion-title-4 fusion-sep-none fusion-title-text fusion-title-size-two" style="--awb-margin-top:0px;--awb-margin-bottom:0px;--awb-margin-top-small:0px;--awb-margin-right-small:0px;--awb-margin-bottom-small:20px;--awb-margin-left-small:0px;--awb-font-size:60px;"><h2 class="fusion-title-heading title-heading-left fusion-responsive-typography-calculated" style="margin:0;font-size:1em;--fontSize:60;line-height:1.33;"><div style="max-width:246px;"><img decoding="async" src="https://newzealandheatpumps.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/lossnay-white.svg" alt="Lossnay Home Ventilation Christchurch" style="width:100%;height:auto;margin-bottom:20px;" /></div>
A ventilation system makes for a healthier and more comfortable home.</h2></div></div></div><div class="caption "><div class="fusion-title-sc-wrapper" style=""><div class="fusion-title title fusion-title-5 fusion-sep-none fusion-title-text fusion-title-size-four" style="--awb-margin-top:0px;--awb-margin-bottom:0px;--awb-margin-top-small:0px;--awb-margin-right-small:0px;--awb-margin-bottom-small:20px;--awb-margin-left-small:0px;--awb-font-size:34px;"><h4 class="fusion-title-heading title-heading-left fusion-responsive-typography-calculated" style="margin:0;font-size:1em;--fontSize:34;line-height:1.2;"><div ><a class="fusion-button button-flat fusion-button-default-size button-default fusion-button-default button-4 fusion-button-default-span fusion-button-default-type" target="_self" title="Home Ventilation Systems" aria-label="Home Ventilation Systems" href="https://newzealandheatpumps.co.nz/home-ventilation-systems/"><span class="fusion-button-text awb-button__text awb-button__text--default">Learn More</span></a></div></h4></div></div></div><div class="buttons" ></div></div></div><div class="background background-image" style="background-image: url(https://newzealandheatpumps.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/lossnay-home-ventilation-christchurch-banner.webp);max-width:100%;height:780px;filter: progid:DXImageTransform.Microsoft.AlphaImageLoader(src='https://newzealandheatpumps.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/lossnay-home-ventilation-christchurch-banner.webp', sizingMethod='scale');" data-imgwidth="1920"></div></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="fusion-fullwidth fullwidth-box fusion-builder-row-2 has-pattern-background has-mask-background nonhundred-percent-fullwidth non-hundred-percent-height-scrolling" style="--awb-border-radius-top-left:0px;--awb-border-radius-top-right:0px;--awb-border-radius-bottom-right:0px;--awb-border-radius-bottom-left:0px;--awb-padding-top:70px;--awb-padding-bottom:50px;--awb-flex-wrap:wrap;" ><div class="fusion-builder-row fusion-row"><div class="fusion-layout-column fusion_builder_column fusion-builder-column-1 fusion_builder_column_1_1 1_1 fusion-one-full fusion-column-first fusion-column-last" style="--awb-bg-blend:overlay;--awb-bg-size:cover;"><div class="fusion-column-wrapper fusion-flex-column-wrapper-legacy"><div class="fusion-text fusion-text-1"><h1>New Zealand Heat Pumps</h1><p>Looking for the best NZ heat pumps? At New Zealand Heat Pumps, we specialise in providing top-quality heat pumps to keep your home comfortable all year round, without stretching your budget. Explore our extensive range and discover competitive <b>heat pump prices</b> that make energy-efficient heating and cooling accessible for every Kiwi household.</p></div><div class="fusion-title title fusion-title-6 fusion-sep-none fusion-title-text fusion-title-size-two" style="--awb-margin-top-small:0px;--awb-margin-right-small:0px;--awb-margin-bottom-small:20px;--awb-margin-left-small:0px;"><h2 class="fusion-title-heading title-heading-left fusion-responsive-typography-calculated" style="margin:0;--fontSize:36;line-height:1.3;">Heat pump deals and specials, installation and service, expert advice. We’re servicing the greater Canterbury region.</h2></div><div class="fusion-title title fusion-title-7 fusion-sep-none fusion-title-text fusion-title-size-three" style="--awb-margin-top:40px;--awb-margin-bottom:0px;--awb-margin-top-small:0px;--awb-margin-right-small:0px;--awb-margin-bottom-small:20px;--awb-margin-left-small:0px;"><h3 class="fusion-title-heading title-heading-left fusion-responsive-typography-calculated" style="margin:0;--fontSize:35;line-height:2.0;">Gentle all season climate control</h3></div><div class="fusion-text fusion-text-2"><h4 class="fusion-responsive-typography-calculated" style="--fontsize: 21; line-height: 1.5; --minfontsize: 21;" data-fontsize="21" data-lineheight="31.5px"><span style="color: #111111; font-size: 20px; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);" data-fusion-font="true">Heat pumps provide healthy comfort for your home. We provide independent advice on all major heat pump brands including Fujitsu General. Our specialists ensure you get the best heat pump for your home. Freephone: 0800 200 400.</span></h4><p style="--fontsize: 21; line-height: 1.5; --minfontsize: 21;"><span style="background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);">Initially established in Christchurch in 2008 by Aaron Trotter and his brother, Aaron has since bought the business and, with the New Zealand Heat Pumps team has built up a reputation in Canterbury for quality, service and innovation</span><span style="background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);">. We know that Heat Pumps are a significant investment for our customers. Our belief is that if your unit is well cared for and enhanced with the latest technology, you can enjoy the optimum performance for the longest life of the unit. When it comes to heating your home or business, New Zealand Heat Pumps has a heating solution for you.</span></p><h3 class="" style="--fontsize: 35; line-height: 2;" data-fontsize="35" data-lineheight="70px">Contact New Zealand Heat Pumps for the best available advice on heat pumps</h3><p>With expert advice, we’ll help you make the right choice to get the right-sized heating solution for you. We supply and install a wide variety of heat pumps and air-conditioning systems for residential, commercial, and industrial spaces. Our range includes:</p><ul><li>Floor consoles</li><li>Wall-mounted (hi-wall) heat pumps</li><li>Ceiling cassettes</li><li>Multi-room systems</li><li>Fully ducted heating and cooling systems</li></ul><p>No matter what your requirements are, you can trust New Zealand Heat Pumps for:</p><ul><li>Competitive heat pump prices</li><li>Air-filtering that relieves allergy symptoms</li><li>Timers for remote control so you can arrive home in the evening to a warm space</li><li>Wide range of colours and designs to fit your décor</li><li>High-quality products backed by a 5 or 6-year warranty</li><li>Professional installation from certified heat pump experts</li><li>Excellent technical expertise and advice</li></ul><p><a href="https://newzealandheatpumps.co.nz/contact/">Contact New Zealand Heat Pumps</a> to book your in-home consultation today.</p></div><div class="fusion-clearfix"></div></div></div></div></div><div class="fusion-fullwidth fullwidth-box fusion-builder-row-3 fusion-flex-container has-pattern-background has-mask-background hundred-percent-fullwidth non-hundred-percent-height-scrolling ghost" style="--awb-border-radius-top-left:0px;--awb-border-radius-top-right:0px;--awb-border-radius-bottom-right:0px;--awb-border-radius-bottom-left:0px;--awb-padding-top:70px;--awb-padding-right:11%;--awb-padding-bottom:60px;--awb-padding-left:11%;--awb-flex-wrap:wrap;" ><div class="fusion-builder-row fusion-row fusion-flex-align-items-flex-start fusion-flex-content-wrap" style="width:104% !important;max-width:104% !important;margin-left: calc(-4% / 2 );margin-right: calc(-4% / 2 );"><div class="fusion-layout-column fusion_builder_column fusion-builder-column-2 fusion_builder_column_1_1 1_1 fusion-flex-column" style="--awb-bg-blend:overlay;--awb-bg-size:cover;--awb-width-large:100%;--awb-margin-top-large:0px;--awb-spacing-right-large:1.92%;--awb-margin-bottom-large:20px;--awb-spacing-left-large:1.92%;--awb-width-medium:100%;--awb-spacing-right-medium:1.92%;--awb-spacing-left-medium:1.92%;--awb-width-small:100%;--awb-spacing-right-small:1.92%;--awb-spacing-left-small:1.92%;"><div class="fusion-column-wrapper fusion-flex-justify-content-flex-start fusion-content-layout-column"><div class="fusion-title title fusion-title-8 fusion-sep-none fusion-title-center fusion-title-text fusion-title-size-two" style="--awb-margin-top-small:0px;--awb-margin-right-small:0px;--awb-margin-bottom-small:20px;--awb-margin-left-small:0px;"><h2 class="fusion-title-heading title-heading-center fusion-responsive-typography-calculated" style="margin:0;--fontSize:36;line-height:1.3;">Learn More about New Zealand Heat Pumps</h2></div></div></div><div class="fusion-layout-column fusion_builder_column fusion-builder-column-3 fusion_builder_column_1_4 1_4 fusion-flex-column learn-more-section" style="--awb-bg-blend:overlay;--awb-bg-size:cover;--awb-width-large:25%;--awb-margin-top-large:0px;--awb-spacing-right-large:7.68%;--awb-margin-bottom-large:20px;--awb-spacing-left-large:7.68%;--awb-width-medium:100%;--awb-spacing-right-medium:1.92%;--awb-spacing-left-medium:1.92%;--awb-width-small:100%;--awb-spacing-right-small:1.92%;--awb-spacing-left-small:1.92%;"><div class="fusion-column-wrapper fusion-flex-justify-content-flex-start fusion-content-layout-column"><div class="fusion-image-element" style="text-align:center;--awb-caption-title-font-family:var(--h2_typography-font-family);--awb-caption-title-font-weight:var(--h2_typography-font-weight);--awb-caption-title-font-style:var(--h2_typography-font-style);--awb-caption-title-size:var(--h2_typography-font-size);--awb-caption-title-transform:var(--h2_typography-text-transform);--awb-caption-title-line-height:var(--h2_typography-line-height);--awb-caption-title-letter-spacing:var(--h2_typography-letter-spacing);"><span class=" fusion-imageframe imageframe-none imageframe-1 hover-type-zoomin"><a class="fusion-no-lightbox" href="https://newzealandheatpumps.co.nz/proud-partners-of-the-kids-foundation-and-idfnz/" target="_self" aria-label="IDFNZ Donation Certificate 2025"><img fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" width="1500" height="994" alt="IDFNZ Donation Certificate 2025" src="https://newzealandheatpumps.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/IDFNZ-Donation-Certificate-2025.webp" class="img-responsive wp-image-2849" srcset="https://newzealandheatpumps.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/IDFNZ-Donation-Certificate-2025-200x133.webp 200w, https://newzealandheatpumps.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/IDFNZ-Donation-Certificate-2025-400x265.webp 400w, https://newzealandheatpumps.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/IDFNZ-Donation-Certificate-2025-600x398.webp 600w, https://newzealandheatpumps.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/IDFNZ-Donation-Certificate-2025-800x530.webp 800w, https://newzealandheatpumps.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/IDFNZ-Donation-Certificate-2025-1200x795.webp 1200w, https://newzealandheatpumps.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/IDFNZ-Donation-Certificate-2025.webp 1500w" sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, (max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1919px) 400px,(min-width: 1920px) 25vw" /></a></span></div><div class="fusion-title title fusion-title-9 fusion-sep-none fusion-title-text fusion-title-size-div" style="--awb-margin-top-small:0px;--awb-margin-right-small:0px;--awb-margin-bottom-small:20px;--awb-margin-left-small:0px;"><div class="fusion-title-heading title-heading-left title-heading-tag fusion-responsive-typography-calculated" style="margin:0;--fontSize:16;--minFontSize:16;line-height:1.6;"><h3><span style="font-size: 21px;">Proudly Supporting The Kids Foundation and IDFNZ</span></h3></div></div><div class="fusion-text fusion-text-3"><p>We believe in doing more than keeping homes comfortable. We’re committed to supporting the wellbeing of our communities.</p></div><div ><a class="fusion-button button-flat button-small button-default fusion-button-default button-5 fusion-button-default-span fusion-button-default-type" target="_self" title="Proud Partners of The Kids Foundation and IDFNZ" aria-label="Proud Partners of The Kids Foundation and IDFNZ" href="https://newzealandheatpumps.co.nz/proud-partners-of-the-kids-foundation-and-idfnz/"><span class="fusion-button-text awb-button__text awb-button__text--default">Read More</span></a></div></div></div><div class="fusion-layout-column fusion_builder_column fusion-builder-column-4 fusion_builder_column_1_4 1_4 fusion-flex-column learn-more-section" style="--awb-bg-blend:overlay;--awb-bg-size:cover;--awb-width-large:25%;--awb-margin-top-large:0px;--awb-spacing-right-large:7.68%;--awb-margin-bottom-large:20px;--awb-spacing-left-